<title>GREECE: BEFORE THE BELL: STOCKS TRADE EX-RIGHTS/BONUS.</title>
<headline>BEFORE THE BELL: STOCKS TRADE EX-RIGHTS/BONUS.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Athens stock exchange said</p>
<p>the following shares will trade ex-bonus on Wednesday:</p>
<p>    COMPANY		 ADJUSTED PRICE	  BONUS TERMS</p>
<p>    NIBID	  15,227		  1-for-10</p>
<p>    NIBID pref   15,136		  1-for-10</p>
<p>Rights of the following stock will be traded on Wednesday.</p>
<p>    RIGHTS		    STARTING PRICE  VOL.LIMIT   MIN LOT</p>
<p>    Lavipharm		    280	     8%	   10</p>
<p>--Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
